WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.334
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:05.271
Look. Every generation
is the "What were you thinking?"
generation.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:08.508
Doctors used to
do cigarette ads.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.644
"A lung surgeon
needs steady hands."

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:12.712
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:18.418
Have you noticed that Trump,
unlike every other president,
did not age in office?

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.818
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:19.918 --> 00:00:20.820
We did!

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:21.788
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.358
Not that I would ever get work
done, not for any moral reason.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:31.197
It's just, it doesn't work.
Now you just look old and weird.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.832
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.935
We have to find our way back
from not loathing each other.

00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:37.971
Facebook.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.239
Stop using it
to argue with some kid

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:43.442
you went to 3rd grade with
about Brett Kavanaugh!

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.678
People didn't use
to talk politics all the time

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:48.748
and they had no idea
how much they hated each other.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.216
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

